+	<!-- custom: Minimum era index where AI workers stop replacing existing no-bonus improvements with lower-food alternatives. BBAI logs showed repeated food-threshold oscillation such as Farm -> Cottage -> Farm and Mine -> Windmill -> Mine. Default 2 = Medieval: before then, cities are often small/capped and early cottages still have time to mature; later, cities are usually larger, health sources and specialist yields are stronger, and rebuilt cottages/growth improvements have less time to pay back, so avoid throwing food away. Set to 0 to apply from Ancient onward, or very high to effectively disable. (ChatGPT-5.5 + GPT-5.5) -->
